While we're on the subject of pits, has anyone noticed the curious
situation that prevails if you have a line of pits? In order to cross
from one to the next, you must crawl (or jump, etc) out of your current
pit and then fall into the next one. Also, digging sideways while in a
pit either digs through the adjacent dungeon wall or "swings through
the air".

I don't think it would be too hard to modify this so that you can walk
through a line of pits that are side-by-side (trench warfare?), and dig
pits in squares adjacent to you.  The special case of digging towards a
wall whilst stuck in a pit is left as an exercise for the reader ;-)

Possibly a small side project for you prolific patch-makers. Heck, I
might do it myself once I get off work for the holidays.



